# 🍕 Pizza Sales Analysis Dashboard

An end-to-end data analysis project focused on understanding pizza sales performance, customer ordering patterns, product demand, and key business metrics using SQL, Excel, and Power BI.

## 📌 Project Overview

The project analyzes pizza sales data to identify revenue trends, high-performing products, customer ordering patterns, and periods of high demand.

The analysis combines SQL-based data analysis with Power BI dashboard development to convert raw sales data into actionable business insights.

## 🎯 Business Objectives

- Analyze overall sales and revenue performance
- Identify the best and worst-selling pizzas
- Understand sales trends over time
- Identify peak ordering hours and high-demand periods
- Analyze performance across pizza categories and sizes
- Track key business performance indicators

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- *SQL* — Data querying and analytical analysis
- *Excel* — Data cleaning and preprocessing
- *Power BI* — Data modeling, DAX, interactive dashboard development and visualization
- *Power Query* — Data transformation and preparation

## 📊 Key KPIs

- Total Revenue
- Total Orders
- Total Pizzas Sold
- Average Order Value
- Average Pizzas per Order
- Best-Selling Pizzas
- Worst-Selling Pizzas
- Peak Sales Periods

## 🔎 Analysis Performed

### Sales Performance
- Revenue and order trends over time
- Daily and monthly sales patterns
- Average order value analysis

### Product Performance
- Best and worst-selling pizzas
- Category-wise sales performance
- Size-wise sales analysis
- Revenue contribution by product

### Customer Ordering Patterns
- Orders by time of day
- Peak ordering hours
- High-demand periods
- Average pizzas ordered per order

## 💡 Key Insights

The analysis helps identify:

- Products and categories contributing significantly to overall sales
- Periods with higher customer demand
- Differences in performance across pizza sizes and categories
- Sales patterns that can support inventory and product planning
- Business KPIs that can be monitored through an interactive dashboard

## 📈 Dashboard

The Power BI dashboard provides an interactive view of:

- Sales KPIs
- Revenue trends
- Product performance
- Category and size analysis
- Time-based sales patterns
- Best and worst-selling products

## 📁 Project Files

- pizza sales power bi project.pbit — Power BI report template
